our expectations with regard to our programs, including client sites, the clinical studies, and reporting results of such studies;

the likelihood and timing of regulatory submissions or related approvals for tab-cel, including the expectations about the timing of approvals for a biologics license application (BLA) for tab-cel® for patients with Epstein-Barr virus with post-transplant lymphoproliferative disease (EBV+ PTLD);

